endpoint.response:
{ success, message, data: { items: [ {
    id: int, name: string, color: string|null, progress_percentage: int|null,
    system_key: "open"|"completed"|"closed"|null,
    work_order_workflow_id: int|null,          // null = set predefinito
    work_order_workflow_name: string|null      // null = set predefinito (etichetta i18n lato FE)
  } ], export_link: null, pagination: { total, offset, limit, total_pages } } }
Ordine: set predefinito per primo, poi workflow per nome, dentro il workflow per `sort_order`.
Workflow inattivi inclusi solo se richiesti via `ids`.
